  - SKILLS: Speak American as Language: Native Tongue 98. The literacy of
    choice is a pick of Literacy: Native Language or Literacy: Other, +15%.
    Horsemanship: Knight is the catalog row (no bonus printed); Magic Lore is
    Lore: Magic 25+10; Demon Lore is Lore: Demons & Monsters 25+20. The two
    energy weapon W.P.s are a pick from the catalog''s energy W.P. rows.
    Hand to Hand: Expert changes to Martial Arts or Assassin for one related
    skill.
  - MONEY: 2D4x1000 credits. The 1D4x1000 in precious metals or gems is not
    coin and stays in the body.
  - EQUIPMENT: three weeks of food rations is three food-rations entries (about
    a week each); 50 feet of strong cord/rope is one cord entry. The Mystic
    Knight body armor (70 M.D.C.), the Demon-Ram helmet (50 M.D.C.), the magic
    sword, three ancient weapons and two modern weapons have no catalog rows
    and are in the body.
